sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Eng as Step transaction (task creation)
  participant Poll as Job poller (every replica)
  participant Q as escalations-due (EngineSweep, idx_pre_task_escalation_due)
  participant DB as pre_instance, pre_task, pre_history, pre_incident
  participant Host as Host event publisher
  Eng->>DB: insert pre_task with due_at
  Eng->>DB: store levels with their fire times and next_escalation_at (level 1)
  Note over Eng,DB: Level times come from the calendar of the SLA, once, with the engine clock
  Poll->>Q: due tasks of every tenant, at most jobs.batch-size, oldest first
  Q-->>Poll: tenant, task, instance
  loop each task, own transaction, as system:timer
    Poll->>DB: lock pre_instance row
    Poll->>DB: reread task and its escalation
    alt instance not RUNNING, task not OPEN or CLAIMED, or level already applied
      Poll-->>Poll: nothing written
    else target user is a four-eyes participant
      Poll->>DB: count the level, ESCALATION_REFUSED in history, incident ESCALATION_TARGET_FORBIDDEN
    else level applies
      Poll->>DB: new assignment, release the claim unless onClaimed is keep, count the level, next_escalation_at
      Poll->>DB: TASK_ESCALATED in history
      Poll->>Host: processes.task.escalated.v1 in the same transaction
    end
  end
